    "created_at": "2016-07-22T22:21:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-22T22:21:49Z",
    "body": "Then it appears that the people at chromium.org got that wrong.\n\nHere: https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=629541#c11 I argued that the browser should display the preview from the video metadata, if present, and if a poster is not present. They say that would require changing the specs and pointed me specifically to that section.\n",
